      "file": "hsk2_sc041_line_001.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "你好，你也是第一次来这个活动吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc041_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "对，我朋友说这里的人都很友好。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc041_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "我叫陈宇，住在附近。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc041_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我叫张伟。很高兴认识你。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc041_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "你来杭州多久了？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc041_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "有一段时间了，现在越来越习惯。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc041_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "你平时周末喜欢做什么？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc041_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "走路、看电影，有时候去咖啡馆学习中文。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc041_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "我也喜欢走路，还喜欢拍照。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc041_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "你经常去哪儿拍？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc041_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "西湖、运河，还有一些老街。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc041_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我最近也开始喜欢慢慢看城市。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc041_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "那以后可以一起走走。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc041_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好啊。我还想认识更多本地朋友。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc041_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "这个活动挺适合认识人的。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc041_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我刚来的时候还有点儿紧张。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc041_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "现在看起来已经放松多了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc041_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "对，认识一个新朋友以后就好多了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
